<title>USA: Secure Computing names Waxman CEO.</title>
<headline>Secure Computing names Waxman CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secure Computing Corp said on Monday it had named Jeffrey Waxman chief executive officer and president, effective November 4.</p>
<p>Kermit Beseke, who joined Secure as president and CEO in 1990, will continue as chairman, it said.</p>
</text>
